<section class='journey' aria-labelledby='journey-title'>
  <header class='journey-header'>
    <div>
      <p class='eyebrow'>Three connected questions</p>
      <h2 id='journey-title'>From motion<br />to <em>interaction.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      A control problem becomes a human problem the moment someone enters the robot’s workspace.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class='chapters'>
    <article class='chapter' data-reveal>
      <div class='chapter-copy'>
        <span class='chapter-number'>01 / CONTROL</span>
        <h3>How much should a robot yield?</h3>
        <p>
          Task compliance is explicit. The parameter γ<sub>k</sub> moves continuously from a stiff operational
          task at 0 to fully compliant behavior at 1.
        </p>
        <span class='chapter-detail'>γ<sub>k</sub> ∈ [0, 1] · task-level response</span>
      </div>
      <div class='chapter-figure compliance-figure' aria-hidden='true'>
